{'symbol': 'CSX', 'date': '2021-12-07 10:00:00', 'title': "CSX EARNS NINTH-CONSECUTIVE ‘A LIST' RECOGNITION FOR CLIMATE LEADERSHIP", 'text': 'JACKSONVILLE, FLA., DEC. 07, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- CSX (NASDAQ: CSX)\xa0LEADERSHIP IN ENVIRONMENTAL SUSTAINABILITY HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED FOR THE NINTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR WITH PLACEMENT ON THE CDP “A LIST” OF COMPANIES TAKING ACTION TO ADDRESS CLIMATE CHANGE.'}